# Mimeoplasm exiles Grizzly Bears as it enters. Bot1's own Eater of the Dead, a different permanent, then exiles Llanowar
# Elves from Bot1's graveyard with its own ability: the exile is Eater of the Dead's, not an ability of Mimeoplasm. The
# owner's ruling (jschibel, 2026-11-24): only an ability of the Mimeoplasm object itself - printed, copied or granted -
# counts as "exiled with it", so its copy ability refuses the Elves, and still becomes a copy of the Bears its own "as it
# enters" ability exiled: a 3/3 Bears.
[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Entomb
Entomb
Mimeoplasm, Revered One
Eater of the Dead
Forest
Grizzly Bears
Llanowar Elves
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Llanowar Elves)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mimeoplasm, Revered One.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Choose(Confirm X)
Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mimeoplasm, Revered One.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 3
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#3.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Eater of the Dead.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T9 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T9 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Eater of the Dead > Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Eater of the Dead.Activate(Bot1.Graveyard.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Grizzly Bears; Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Mimeoplasm, Revered One.Activate(Exile.Llanowar Elves; Ability: becomes a copy)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mimeoplasm, Revered One.Activate(Exile.Grizzly Bears; Ability: becomes a copy)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T9 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Grizzly Bears; Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Battlefield.Mimeoplasm, Revered One = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Toughness = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 3